 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "blocks lists busy periods [personId, startDay, endDay] (inclusive days, 1-indexed; a person may have overlapping blocks). The horizon is days 1..totalDays; blocks may extend past it. The people are the distinct person ids in blocks. Given k (0 <= k <= number of people), return the maximal runs of days in 1..totalDays on which at least k people are free, as [start, end] pairs in ascending order. A person is busy on a day covered by any of their blocks; overlapping blocks of one person count once.",
